247:### Inspector Sheet
248-- **Corner Style:** 10px. **Background:** glass with 16px blur and a hairline border. **Shadow:** Float.
249-- **Head:** the layer name with its glyph (12px/600) and one ink-3 line saying what the ring encodes.
250-- **Body:** a title or the customer quote, an optional instrument figure, then a two-column fact grid (micro label over 13px ink-2 value).
251-- **Close:** a 30px square icon button, 8px radius, ink-3 to ink on hover with a 7% white wash. Esc closes; clicking empty space closes.
252-- **Entry:** fades in from 6px above over 240ms.
253-- **Charts inside:** neutral only (ink, ink-3, hairline outlines for forecasts); the categorical hue stays in the glyph.
